    { question: "Is the free tattoo consent form generator really free?", answer: "Yes. Generate unlimited tattoo consent and waiver forms for free. No account or signup required, and nothing to download — the form is built in your browser." },
    { question: "What should a tattoo consent form include?", answer: "A proper form combines informed consent (the client understands the procedure is permanent and the risks), a liability release, a health-screening block (medications, allergies, skin conditions, pregnancy), and an aftercare acknowledgment — then a dated signature." },
    { question: "Can I customize the waiver fields?", answer: "Yes. Choose which sections to include — medical history, liability and consent, photo release — and add your studio name, address, and policies before generating." },
