      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Minors are where consent forms matter most — and where the rules diverge sharply by location. Some states permit tattooing a minor only with a <strong class="text-white">notarized parental consent form and the parent present</strong>; others prohibit tattooing anyone under 18 entirely, no exceptions. Because requirements sit at the state, county, and even city level, confirm your local health code before booking a minor. The free generator's parental-consent field lets you capture guardian details whenever your jurisdiction requires them.</p>
